@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@token = replace-with-access-token
@id = 18fdcc69-269d-4c1a-9123-56f83cd36d50

### List active messages (Message.Read)
GET {{baseUrl}}/messages/manage?page=1&pageSize=50&search=&letter=
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List deleted messages (Message.Read and RawDatabase.Manage)
GET {{baseUrl}}/messages/manage?deleted=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Message details (Message.Read)
GET {{baseUrl}}/messages/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create (Message.Write); use returned id in subsequent requests
POST {{baseUrl}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Maintenance notice",
  "title": "Scheduled maintenance",
  "content": "<p>The site will be unavailable briefly.</p>",
  "level": "warning",
  "startsAt": "2026-11-12T12:00:00Z",
  "endsAt": "2026-11-12T13:00:00Z"
}

### Update (Message.Write)
POST {{baseUrl}}/messages/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Maintenance complete",
  "title": "",
  "content": "<p>The site is available again.</p>",
  "level": "success",
  "startsAt": null,
  "endsAt": null
}

### Public widget; 404 outside schedule or when deleted
GET {{baseUrl}}/widgets/messages/{{id}}

### Soft delete (Message.Delete)
POST {{baseUrl}}/messages/{{id}}/delete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Restore (RawDatabase.Manage)
POST {{baseUrl}}/messages/{{id}}/restore
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Permanently delete a previously deleted message (RawDatabase.Manage)
POST {{baseUrl}}/messages/{{id}}/hard/delete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
